WEBVTT

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.510
What a lovely song...

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:38.370
Do you want to live?

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:42.030
That's a given...

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:44.520
I don't want to die.

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:47.810
Why... do you wish to live?

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:52.750
My little sister... I
have a little sister.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.540
I haven't seen her since we were little,

00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.840
but she's my only sister.

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:03.240
"I swear I will come for you."

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:06.780
Despite how fervently I made that oath,

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.180
I still haven't fulfilled that promise.

00:01:13.030 --> 00:01:13.790
That's why...

00:01:15.660 --> 00:01:16.540
...I want to live...

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.020
...and stay by her side.

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:02.900
Encounter

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:07.440
Shino, come along.

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:08.500
'Kay!

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:09.640
Later.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.280
Bro, where do ya think you're goin'?

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:15.340
I'm going to sit with Shino and-

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.090
No, you aren't!

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:20.590
The two of us are sittin'
in second class.

00:03:32.450 --> 00:03:35.010
Excuse me, but may we sit here?

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:37.310
Sure, I don't mind.

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.460
Then if you'll pardon us.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.230
Shino, you may take the window seat.

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:52.210
We won't reach the Imperial
Capital until evening,

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.390
so feel free to get some sleep.

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:55.990
'Kay!

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.100
Are both of you with the Church?

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:02.260
Are you brothers?

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:05.510
Yes. And we're like brothers.

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:09.150
For belonging to the Church,
you certainly have it good.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:11.520
This is the first-class car.

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:13.970
Or is this the norm?

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:18.370
Hardly. I wouldn't be
here if I was on my own,

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:20.240
but since he's with me today...

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.030
It is a long way to
the Imperial Capital.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:24.000
Sosuke.

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:25.530
Is something the matter?

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.910
Outside. It's pouring rain.

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:33.920
Indeed. I never noticed it start up.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:39.280
Earlier the conductor announced
that a storm was headed our way.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:43.420
Hopefully we'll make it to the
Imperial Capital without any delays.

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.040
There is a storm?

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.130
Even though it was lovely
just a minute ago?

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:52.460
Shino?

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:55.940
The rain must have
dropped the temperature.

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:58.680
Please wait here for a minute.

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:02.820
I will run by the lounge and pick up
something hot for you to drink.

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:08.700
Your brother is mighty
overprotective, huh?

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:12.450
Or do you expect that of him?

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:14.330
Snow...

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:14.710
Huh?

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:16.840
It smells of snow.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.400
This child...

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:24.990
What made him come out with that?

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:30.580
Wouldn't it be funny if
this rain turned into snow?

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:34.250
Y-you know that isn't possible!

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:37.480
This isn't exactly the season for snow.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.100
Yeah, normally.

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:44.910
But still, I'd love to see some snow
in the dead of summer...

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:46.240
Wouldn't you?

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:54.270
It's snowing!

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:55.130
Really?

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:56.360
Isn't that snow?

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:06.180
Lucky!

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:15.430
Hey!

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:23.520
Hell's bells! Dere was
a sheat right 'ere.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:28.030
Dam' conductor! Lyin' through 'is teeth.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:31.910
Hey, ya stinkin' brat! Move yer ass!

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:38.780
I swear, who's he thin' he is,
makin' a customer stand! Sheesh!

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:43.020
No, the conductor was
correct in what he said.

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:45.240
This is the first-class car.

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:49.430
Men of your caliber aren't
supposed to be allowed in here.

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.650
What wazzat?!

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:56.440
Actin' like yer better'n me!
It's 'cause of jerks like you-

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:01.100
Have a taste of this!

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:01.630
What're you-?!

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.580
Damn it...!

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:08.980
Oh, no!

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:15.260
Twerp, I'll teach ya-

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.580
Perfect. Now don't move from that spot.

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:22.330
Good job!

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.590
An-an eyeball?

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:28.310
Shino, does some milk tea sound good?

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:29.200
Yeah!

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:33.850
Ah, the snow turned back to rain.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:37.730
Snow in the middle of summer
made for a most unusual sight.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:38.590
Yep.

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:41.350
The eyeball... The eyeball...!

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:44.480
It's an eyeball!

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:54.510
Mutsuki.

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:01.410
Mutsuki, someday, I swear...

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:04.000
-ji?

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:05.780
Hamaji?

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:07.850
Hamaji, are you listening?

00:08:09.170 --> 00:08:10.750
It's your turn.

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:14.490
Tenko is itching for you to take
the Old Maid from his hand.

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:17.230
Hey, Hamaji.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:19.430
Hamaji!

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:21.270
Oh, jeez!

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.620
Could you kindly stop calling my name
over and over again?

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:31.280
Goodness, where were my manners?

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:35.400
I wonder why...

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:39.280
I haven't felt this annoyed...
in such a long time.

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:43.280
Mutsuki... Mutsuki...

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:47.950
They'll be fine.

00:08:49.570 --> 00:08:53.360
What? Weren't you listening
to me? I'm hurt!

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:58.090
There is no need to worry;
Shii and Sosuke will be back soon.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:02.560
Yes, that's right...

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:09.030
This kid sleeps like a babe.

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:12.720
I had to wake him up early this morning.

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:16.950
Besides, aren't children supposed
to need a lot of sleep?

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:21.440
Is that really all it is? This kid...

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.670
The snow responded to
this kid's desires.

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:27.850
And then there's this guy.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:30.160
How can he handle sitting in the same

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:32.090
cabin with me like it's nothing?

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:38.580
Normally wouldn't a person be freezing?

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.100
Plus...

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.610
There is that creature
of unknown origin!

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.610
Oh, you've managed to
shrink down quite a bit.

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:53.870
It shrunk!

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:57.110
If Shino finds you, this time
you'll get tossed out for sure.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:01.620
Wh-what the hell are these guys?!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:16.800
Oh, I can smell it! I smell it!

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:19.500
It's rancid with the
stench of evil spirit!

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:20.760
Now where is it?

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:25.640
To think that a lowly monster
is on the same train as me!

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:30.520
By my stars, the times have changed.

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:35.330
And what is this?

00:10:35.850 --> 00:10:39.530
It's summer, yet this
car is horribly cold.

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:43.280
The eyeball... The eyeball!

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:44.540
Hey there, drunk!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:47.540
You'll freeze to death if you
go to sleep in a place like this.

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:53.290
It's in there!

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:01.950
I've found you, evil spirits!

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:04.810
I, Chudai, I will exorcize you promptly!

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.770
There are three of you?

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.250
How vile! Adopting the form of humans.

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:28.010
So that is your true form!

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:33.080
Accursed demon!

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:42.470
Accursed demon!

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:03.560
Snow?

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:06.370
Snow Princess?

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:25.400
I knew it was you, Snow Princess!

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:26.410
Long time no see.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:27.640
Huh?

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:29.060
Yay!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:31.000
W-wait a second here!

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:34.900
Kiddo, how come you can touch her?

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:37.650
Scratch that. You actually
know each other?

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:42.080
Yeah. She saved me when
I was lost in the forest

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:43.410
while it was snowing.

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:46.660
Ever since then, we've hung out
with the coming of each winter.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:50.660
Oh? You got lost in the forest?

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:52.910
You never mentioned this to me.

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:56.370
Snow Princess, I'm surprised
to see you in a place like this.

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:58.750
The Lord of the Forest
was worried about you!

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:00.880
He said he hasn't seen you in a while.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.150
What've you been up to?

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:15.690
Oh, so you've been with him?

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:20.650
Whatever. This makes things easy.

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:22.790
I've got a favor I'm
dying to ask of you.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.070
I'm begging you!

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:29.020
Could you please convince her
to leave me alone?!

00:13:29.020 --> 00:13:30.080
Please!

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:31.260
Huh?

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:32.910
I can't take it anymore!

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.920
Ever since she latched onto me,

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:34.540
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:38.660
my girlfriend and all of my pals
have left me in disgust.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:43.090
Winter's a given, but around me,
even summer is freezing cold!

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:44.380
Wow!

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:46.840
My body is cold, but my
heart is even colder.

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:49.850
I've had it up to here!

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:50.970
I can't help ya.

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:52.590
Why not?!

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:54.940
For starters, Snow Princess never

00:13:54.940 --> 00:13:57.100
appears before humans
around this time of year.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:59.930
She must really wanna protect you.

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:03.680
And if Snow Princess really
did leave your side,

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:05.410
you'd die.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:13.260
I bet you were dying in the
snow and she saved ya.

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:14.500
Give it up.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:18.350
Th-then I have to spend the
rest of my life like this?

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:21.550
Don't think you're the only
one making a sacrifice.

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:26.380
To keep you alive, Snow Princess
had her own price to pay.

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:30.380
In exchange for the life of
a mere human, this spirit...

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:34.480
At the very least, she-

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:57.000
Shino, we will reach
the Imperial Capital

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.660
shortly upon crossing this bridge.

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:09.590
Now then, what should we
do with this gentleman?

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:11.780
Not my problem. Just leave him.

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:15.570
The eye...! The eyeball!

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.840
I'm fine, Princess.

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:26.960
I've grown accustomed to the cold.

00:15:29.690 --> 00:15:33.420
Princess, you saved my life, didn't you?

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:35.280
Thank you...

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:43.090
That having been said, don't
you want to see them off?

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:46.340
Hasn't it been a while since
you saw these friends of yours?

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:50.730
How strange to think that
you have human friends.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:57.850
Crap! I forgot to ask for their names.

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:04.630
Hey! Wait up, you two!
The giant and the pea!

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:05.810
Hold up!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.350
Giant?

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:08.610
Pea?

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:15.120
I'm Dosetsu! Dosetsu
Inuyama! Who're you?

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:18.550
Sosuke Inukawa.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.370
Shino Inuzuka.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:24.630
See ya later, Snow Princess!
You too, Dosetsu.

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:27.130
No honorific title?

00:16:28.190 --> 00:16:30.880
Oh, right! Murasame wants
to say goodbye, too.

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:33.880
Snow!

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:39.930
Take care!

00:16:41.380 --> 00:16:43.890
A freaking crow came out of his arm!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:55.410
Shino, what was the price
Snow Princess paid to save his life?

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:57.580
Huh? Oh...

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.320
She used to have a pretty voice.

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:07.220
She was always singing.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:11.230
I loved her songs.

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.440
I could only hear them
during the snowy seasons.

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:17.660
They were just like lullabies...

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:24.740
And now I'll never hear them again.

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:22.840
What a lovely song...

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:45.330
Do you want to live?

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:48.850
That's a given...

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:51.340
I don't want to die.

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:55.280
Why... do you wish to live?

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:58.110
I have a little sister.

00:18:58.680 --> 00:19:02.700
I haven't seen her since we were little,

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:06.190
but she's my only sister.

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:11.540
She isn't nearly as pretty as you,

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:16.500
but she is my one and only,
truly adorable, little sister.

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:24.100
I made just one promise
with the little lass.

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:26.700
I still haven't fulfilled it...

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:29.330
I am a poor excuse of a brother,

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.060
but I want to see her all grown up...

00:19:33.650 --> 00:19:37.760
I'll go to her and apologize
for taking so long to show up.

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:39.130
And then...

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:42.590
I want to live...

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:45.640
...and stay by her side.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:58.340
You have expressed the exact
same sentiment as my only friend.

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:02.250
If that is how you feel,
I shall save your life.

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:43.790
C'mon in. Grab a bite before ya go.

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:45.150
Sweet!

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:46.320
Sorry to put you out.

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:48.820
Welcome home, my vagrant son.

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:50.910
I'm back!

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:54.120
Our guests are eating in the back!
Go wait on them immediately!

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:55.080
Yes, Ma'am!

00:21:56.420 --> 00:21:58.250
You are truly welcome guests here.

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:01.380
We're having sukiyaki tonight,
so eat to your heart's content.

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:03.260
Sukiyaki!

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:05.130
What's this?

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:06.450
Keno...?

00:22:06.840 --> 00:22:07.630
Howdy!

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:10.640
Welcome! Welcome to the Kona-ya.

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:14.560
Hmm, so you are one of
the attendants here.

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:17.060
No, I'm the innkeeper's son.

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:17.850
Her son?

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:22.480
We'll be staying in the
Imperial Capital for a spell.

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:23.900
Thanks for taking care of us.

00:22:25.570 --> 00:22:27.150
Huh? Aren't you...?

00:22:27.150 --> 00:22:28.160
Meat!

00:22:28.990 --> 00:22:31.030
Thanks for the feast!

00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:33.660
Ah, Murasame! That piece was mine!

00:22:33.990 --> 00:22:35.910
Shino, there is some more over here.

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:37.540
Asakeno, your sleeves.

00:22:37.830 --> 00:22:39.710
Oops, that was close.

00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:42.460
Shino, you're welcome to eat this meat.

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:48.010
It's good!

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:50.260
Yes, yes. I'm glad to hear it.

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:56.770
Ah! The piece I was nurturing is gone!

00:22:56.770 --> 00:22:58.810
Nurture it in your own field.

00:22:58.850 --> 00:22:59.270
An interesting crowd is starting to form, isn't it?
Field...?

00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:00.190
An interesting crowd is starting to form, isn't it?
Mine!

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:00.690
An interesting crowd is
starting to form, isn't it?

00:23:00.690 --> 00:23:02.400
An interesting crowd is starting to form, isn't it?
This all belongs to me!

00:23:02.400 --> 00:23:02.980
There is plenty to go around.

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:04.150
We're gathering around him...
There is plenty to go around.

00:23:04.150 --> 00:23:05.230
Mine!

00:23:06.940 --> 00:23:09.550
It's just like he's a magnet,
drawing us to him...

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:11.720
There's no denying it.

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:23.000
They still aren't back yet.

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:25.380
Not much I can do about that...

00:23:26.280 --> 00:25:00.000
Guard

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:29.130
So, see, I don't have a family!

00:23:29.130 --> 00:23:31.510
I can't find my little sister!
And I lost my girlfriend!

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:33.430
What am I supposed to live for?!

00:23:33.430 --> 00:23:34.390
Wouldn't you agree?

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:35.220
Am I supposed to?

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:37.730
Aren't you a bit emotionless
for a young man?

